{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21138","headline":"虫豸诗  三 · 元稹","name":"虫豸诗  三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉帝斩蛇劒，晋时烧上天。\n自兹繁巨蟒，往往寿千年。\n白昼遮长道，青溪蒸毒烟。\n战龙苍海外，平地血浮船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}